lking on the golden  sands and walking along the beach before  emma walked over by the water  over recent days speculation has been  rife that the series is being  filmed in the southern county after  workers were spotted in different  locations last week  on monday photos emerged showing a film  set had appeared on the hollywell bay  beach  suggesting that it could be used in  scenes featuring matt in emma and the  medieval castle on saint michael's mount  on mounts bay in cornwall where filming  is also said to be taking place  bears a striking resemblance to the  castle inhabited by cersei lannister  the castle has a breathtaking view of  the north sea with much of the filming  said to be taking place in the lower  reaches of the mount within days  now i know they have been using this set  for the home of house velaryon but i  really do think they could be using the  beach for dragonstone scenes as well  i'm sure we will find out more  information very soon  now that photos are hitting the internet  things will only snowball from here  i don't know how many of you followed my  channel during the filming of game of  thrones season 7 or game of thrones  season 8 but as soon as filming began  i was making videos almost every day now  that house of the dragon is filming  we will start to see new photos come out  almost every day as well  we might even see some long videos of  them filming scenes  and who knows maybe someone working on  the set that day will spill the beans on  what's actually happening  in those scenes we shall see if you are  interested in watching how this first  season gets made  i would highly recommend subscribing to  my channel now because as i said in my  last video  i will document everything each step of  the way  now i don't want to do too much  speculating about what could be  happening in these photos because it's  really hard to say right now  since they don't always film the  episodes in order they could be  discussing just about anything  if any more information is released i  will make a video letting you know as  soon as i can  i don't know about all of you but these  photos have me very excited  everything feels so official now one  thing i do know is this fandom is about  to get a lot more interesting now that  westeros is coming back to life  again i just hope all of you come along  for the ride it should be fun  let me know what you think about these  new images do you like the way they look  do you like their outfits leave me your  thoughts down below  as always i want to thank everyone for  stopping by to check out my quick update  video  i hope all of you have a great day i  will see you again very soon  bye  [Music]  [Music]  you

